    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "第十九話　鐵漢柔情震哮天，未許佳人念恩師"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "六年前。二零零一年二月十三日。大尾篤燒烤場。街燈昏黃。一頭黑狗橫在路上。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "救命啊！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "youmu",
      "expr": "01-shout",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "youmu",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "停手！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他拿著從公廁拿來的掃帚。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "youmu"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "大哥哥！快來救我啊！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "youmu",
      "expr": "01-shout",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "youmu",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "別著急，有我游牧在此。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他對那頭狗說。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "youmu",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "好狗唔攔路。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "狗還是撲過來，把他左腿咬下一塊。後來那頭狗跑了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "youmu"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "你的腳沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "youmu",
      "expr": "01-shout",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "youmu",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "唏！男子漢怎麼這般婆婆媽媽的！你要是老是這個又膽小又婆媽的樣子，怎麼保護自己喜歡的女孩子啊！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "那一夜的星空很亮。牧夫座大角星是紅的。"
    },
